WEBVTT

00:00:02.035 --> 00:00:05.369
Our armored tank division has
surrounded the Peterburg frontier.

00:00:05.739 --> 00:00:07.935
Emperor Alexander has refused our
request for unconditional surrender...

00:00:08.008 --> 00:00:10.375
...and is preparing for
all-out resistance.

00:00:10.777 --> 00:00:12.643
Luchs, status report!

00:00:12.712 --> 00:00:16.706
The active mobility of
the Kligger ll is at 97%.

00:00:16.783 --> 00:00:18.683
All troops have been
deployed to the front.

00:00:18.752 --> 00:00:20.311
Good. Commence the invasion!

00:00:20.387 --> 00:00:21.877
TAKE PETERBURG DOWN!

00:00:47.213 --> 00:00:50.444
| came to this land to protect you.

00:00:50.817 --> 00:00:54.014
| was born to be with you.

00:00:54.387 --> 00:00:57.357
The moment I awoke...

00:00:58.024 --> 00:01:01.483
...prisms surrounded me.

00:01:01.628 --> 00:01:04.962
I'm here to love you now.

00:01:05.331 --> 00:01:08.733
I was born to hold you.

00:01:08.935 --> 00:01:11.905
Lies and truths...

00:01:12.505 --> 00:01:16.032
...are all within ourselves.

00:01:16.910 --> 00:01:20.813
The days I abandon my true feelings...

00:01:21.181 --> 00:01:22.649
...won't get to me.

00:01:23.049 --> 00:01:26.178
Tenderness and caring...

00:01:26.719 --> 00:01:29.711
...can be ours once again!

00:01:30.090 --> 00:01:34.323
Day in, day out,
like a puppet on a string.

00:01:34.394 --> 00:01:38.160
Wandering in the void
between zero and infinity.

00:01:38.231 --> 00:01:41.565
The strength to sever
the tangled wires...

00:01:41.634 --> 00:01:46.333
...is still sleeping inside of you.

00:01:55.982 --> 00:02:00.544
If We All Go To Gartlant Together,
It won't Be So Scary

00:02:19.405 --> 00:02:20.950
"OVERTHROWN! Faust Launches Surprise Attack On
Peterburg!” This is a special news bulletin!

00:02:20.974 --> 00:02:23.875
"OVERTHROWN! Faust Launches Surprise Attack On Peterburg!” Earlier
this morning, the Gartlant Army launched a sudden invasion...

00:02:24.043 --> 00:02:27.809
...and captured Peterburg. I repeat!
Earlier this morning, the Gartlant...

00:02:28.515 --> 00:02:33.612
Everybody, listen up! There's talk
that Faust's next target could be US!

00:02:33.686 --> 00:02:34.847
You serious?!

00:02:34.921 --> 00:02:36.286
Just let him try!

00:02:36.356 --> 00:02:38.085
Fights and fires are
the soul of Japoness!

00:02:38.158 --> 00:02:39.935
"*REAL* FORTUNE-TELLER"
The good will perish...

00:02:39.959 --> 00:02:42.037
"*REAL* FORTUNE-TELLER" ...but those who
believe in the evil will not achieve salvation!

00:02:42.061 --> 00:02:42.584
...but those who believe in the evil
will not achieve salvation!

00:02:45.565 --> 00:02:47.863
Faust has finally done it.

00:02:52.405 --> 00:02:54.396
<i>Are we really in for a war...?</i>

00:02:55.175 --> 00:02:57.473
Otaru... What's a "war"?

00:02:59.546 --> 00:03:01.844
Tell me! What's a "war"?

00:03:01.981 --> 00:03:04.643
A "war" is like a
big, pointless fight.

00:03:05.418 --> 00:03:07.386
- It's pointless?
- Yup.

00:03:09.222 --> 00:03:11.452
Then, we shouldn't have one.

00:03:11.524 --> 00:03:13.117
That's true...

00:03:13.193 --> 00:03:16.026
It'll be okay!
I'll protect you, Otaru!

00:03:16.095 --> 00:03:17.563
Hey, thanks!

00:03:19.666 --> 00:03:21.134
All right!!

00:03:32.111 --> 00:03:34.739
Hey! A mousie!!

00:03:42.956 --> 00:03:45.482
"Peter Piper picked a
peck of pickled peppers."

00:03:45.558 --> 00:03:48.789
Fingerprint, voiceprint,
and eyeprint scanners?

00:03:48.861 --> 00:03:50.522
This place is pretty tight.

00:03:59.672 --> 00:04:01.140
Shogun!

00:04:04.077 --> 00:04:05.875
What the hell happened?!

00:04:05.945 --> 00:04:08.243
The Shogun was hit
by the dummy Faust.

00:04:13.152 --> 00:04:15.143
When it exploded, you mean?

00:04:15.221 --> 00:04:17.690
He was severely injured.

00:04:17.757 --> 00:04:18.849
Oh, no!

00:04:18.925 --> 00:04:21.826
So, can he be saved?

00:04:21.894 --> 00:04:23.828
Yes... He is out of danger.

00:04:23.896 --> 00:04:26.388
For now, however, he
requires complete bedrest...

00:04:26.466 --> 00:04:28.764
...right when his country
needs him the most!

00:04:29.702 --> 00:04:31.033
Shogun...

00:04:32.171 --> 00:04:33.798
Please get well, soon!

00:04:46.119 --> 00:04:49.214
To think this happened to him...

00:04:49.989 --> 00:04:51.889
Hey, it'll be fine, Cherry!

00:04:51.958 --> 00:04:53.926
He'll get better!

00:04:54.927 --> 00:04:56.395
Yes!

00:04:56.996 --> 00:05:01.024
Otaru! I'm worried
about that old man, too!

00:05:01.100 --> 00:05:01.999
H-Hey!

00:05:02.068 --> 00:05:05.003
Hey, Bloodberry!
Don't cut in on my action!

00:05:05.972 --> 00:05:09.772
We were just setting the mood
when you had to butt in!

00:05:09.842 --> 00:05:11.367
Oh, get out! Me and
Otaru are so intimate...

00:05:11.444 --> 00:05:13.173
...that we exchanged wedding vows!

00:05:13.246 --> 00:05:15.977
Where did you get that from?!
Since when, you dreamer?!

00:05:16.049 --> 00:05:17.574
- H-Hey...
- YOU'RE the dreamer!

00:05:17.650 --> 00:05:18.446
- You guys!
- What did you say?!

00:05:18.518 --> 00:05:20.680
I'm going to make
a real man out of him!

00:05:20.753 --> 00:05:22.118
Just because your
breasts are bigger...

00:05:22.188 --> 00:05:24.247
CEASE THIS AT ONCE"

00:05:24.691 --> 00:05:26.591
How dare you bicker
during this crisis?!

00:05:26.659 --> 00:05:28.855
The Shogun needs
TOTAL QUIET!!

00:05:31.097 --> 00:05:32.064
HOLD IT RIGHT THERE'"!

00:05:32.131 --> 00:05:34.600
I hope he recovers soon.

00:05:35.268 --> 00:05:38.602
Yes... But, we cannot wait
for the Shogun to recover.

00:05:39.806 --> 00:05:41.638
| am certain that we should attack!

00:05:41.708 --> 00:05:44.734
But we don't stand a chance
against Gartlant's armored division!

00:05:49.282 --> 00:05:52.912
No, we must form a barricade!
| would stake three ryo on it!

00:05:52.985 --> 00:05:55.682
No, we should definitely attack!
I'd stake two ryo on it!

00:05:57.156 --> 00:05:59.284
All right then,
one ryo on the barricade!

00:05:59.592 --> 00:06:02.289
Excuse me, but aren't bets
supposed to get HIGHER...?

00:06:02.695 --> 00:06:04.163
YOU TWITS!

00:06:04.230 --> 00:06:05.857
Of all the ridiculous...

00:06:13.539 --> 00:06:15.439
| caught you, mousie!

00:06:16.409 --> 00:06:17.638
Lime...!!

00:06:17.710 --> 00:06:19.178
Oh, Otaru!

00:06:22.482 --> 00:06:24.075
- LIME!
-Yes...?

00:06:24.150 --> 00:06:28.883
Don't "yes" me! I'll have you know
that statue was incredibly expensive!

00:06:30.156 --> 00:06:33.990
It's Otaru Mamiya! The one who
saved the Shogun, not once, but TWICE!

00:06:34.594 --> 00:06:37.564
Ooh! Why, these are the three
invincible marionettes.."

00:06:38.931 --> 00:06:40.399
HEY, HEY, HEY, HEY!!

00:06:40.466 --> 00:06:42.958
I've had enough of this crap!
The Shogun is in critical condition...

00:06:43.035 --> 00:06:45.333
...the country is in jeopardy,
but just LOOK AT YOU!

00:06:45.405 --> 00:06:49.171
When I think that the future of the
common folk is in your hands...

00:06:49.242 --> 00:06:51.609
...I could almost WEEP! You BOZOS"!

00:06:52.545 --> 00:06:54.513
Ooh! Aah!

00:06:55.681 --> 00:06:57.308
Now, see here...

00:06:59.018 --> 00:07:00.452
Hey! I'm talking to you!

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:02.010
And we're listening!

00:07:02.088 --> 00:07:04.648
You, Master Otaru, become so
impressed with our inadequacy...

00:07:05.024 --> 00:07:08.824
...that you take your three marionettes
on a mission to infiltrate Gartlant...

00:07:09.195 --> 00:07:13.063
...to destroy the computer that
manages their military tactics!

00:07:13.132 --> 00:07:15.726
H-Hold the phone!
Where did THAT come from?!

00:07:15.802 --> 00:07:18.100
I'm an ordinary citizen,
not a samurai!!

00:07:18.638 --> 00:07:20.470
We have no one else to turn to!

00:07:20.540 --> 00:07:23.305
In only a matter of days,
they will invade Japoness!

00:07:23.943 --> 00:07:25.934
We will hold them back
for as long as we can...

00:07:26.012 --> 00:07:28.572
...while you take out
their main computer.

00:07:29.215 --> 00:07:34.051
Once you do that, their sabers will
shut down, and Japoness will be saved!

00:07:34.120 --> 00:07:34.985
Uh...

00:07:35.054 --> 00:07:36.920
| beg you as well,
for all our sakes.

00:07:36.989 --> 00:07:38.218
W-Why?

00:07:38.291 --> 00:07:41.522
Get lost! I hate war!

00:07:41.594 --> 00:07:45.053
Besides, there is no way I'm
making them fight! We're leaving!

00:07:45.131 --> 00:07:48.431
- Please don't go!
- Succeed, and you will return a HERO!

00:07:48.501 --> 00:07:51.129
- I'm not interested. You would be in the history
books! There would be a statue in your honor!!

00:07:51.204 --> 00:07:53.605
-I don't want one! Your own
CD release! Autograph sessions!

00:07:53.673 --> 00:07:56.836
Rice cracker trading cards, with a free
album for each specially marked card!

00:07:58.010 --> 00:07:59.478
<i>Y-You mean it?</i>

00:07:59.545 --> 00:08:00.842
"HISTORY"

00:08:00.913 --> 00:08:02.506
FAMOUS QUOTES:
"Education Is Love." - Otaru

00:08:04.283 --> 00:08:04.560
"CANDY STORE"

00:08:04.584 --> 00:08:06.143
"CANDY STORE"
Otaru crackers, please!

00:08:08.221 --> 00:08:09.450
It's Otarut

00:08:09.522 --> 00:08:11.490
And, it's a specially marked card"

00:08:12.492 --> 00:08:14.790
Yuck! I got Hanagata again.

00:08:14.861 --> 00:08:17.523
It's #94,
"Die An Agonizing Death."

00:08:17.597 --> 00:08:19.065
That's bad luck.

00:08:19.665 --> 00:08:21.599
Hey, it's him! It's Otaru®!

00:08:24.670 --> 00:08:25.933
Oh, YEAH"

00:08:26.005 --> 00:08:28.167
Just you leave it to me!

00:08:28.674 --> 00:08:30.403
Leave it to me!

00:08:30.476 --> 00:08:31.875
D-Do you mean it?!

00:08:31.944 --> 00:08:35.574
Indeed, I do! I will turn
the tide to Japoness's favor!

00:08:35.648 --> 00:08:37.173
To Japoness's favor!

00:08:37.250 --> 00:08:39.548
Then, use this.

00:08:41.988 --> 00:08:43.478
This is COOL!

00:08:43.556 --> 00:08:46.184
All right! This clinches it!

00:08:46.259 --> 00:08:50.526
Leave it to me. I'll demolish
that Gartlant computer!

00:08:51.030 --> 00:08:53.522
- Banzai! Banzai! Banzai!
- We're depending upon you.

00:08:56.536 --> 00:08:59.005
"Kasahari Apartments”

00:08:59.572 --> 00:09:03.475
Otaru, Otaru, Otaru!
How could you be such a nincompoop?!

00:09:03.543 --> 00:09:05.841
There's no way in hell
you can sneak into Gartlant!

00:09:06.946 --> 00:09:08.937
STUPID, STUPID, STUPID, STUPID!
I'm so STUPIDM!

00:09:09.382 --> 00:09:12.647
I'm so sorry, guys. I... I...

00:09:13.586 --> 00:09:16.419
I've always been a sucker
for candy with prizes in 'em!

00:09:16.489 --> 00:09:16.978
Uh?

00:09:17.056 --> 00:09:19.150
Hanagata, I want
you to scold me!

00:09:19.225 --> 00:09:21.125
OTARU, YOU UTTER
NINCOMPOOP!!

00:09:21.360 --> 00:09:23.351
CARELESS FOOL!
HAPPY-GO-LUCKY!

00:09:23.429 --> 00:09:25.864
BRAINLESS IDIOT!
SPORTS GEEK™

00:09:25.932 --> 00:09:27.400
WHAT'D YOU CALL ME?!?

00:09:29.168 --> 00:09:30.431
Dumbass!

00:09:30.503 --> 00:09:33.063
For some reason, I just can't
STAND being scolded by him.

00:09:33.139 --> 00:09:35.039
Now, that's not very fair...

00:09:35.107 --> 00:09:37.075
But that's just another
thing I like about you.

00:09:38.244 --> 00:09:39.075
Yeah, it isn't fair.

00:09:40.146 --> 00:09:43.116
I'd be putting Lime and the
others in danger as well...

00:09:47.386 --> 00:09:49.878
This is how I propose
we infiltrate Gartlant.

00:09:49.956 --> 00:09:52.891
Flying in is out of the question, and
going by land is very limited as well.

00:09:52.959 --> 00:09:54.893
Yes. I think it would be best...

00:09:54.961 --> 00:09:57.521
...to utilize the underground
caverns at the city limits.

00:09:57.597 --> 00:09:59.531
Terra ll is a stratified planet.

00:09:59.599 --> 00:10:02.000
In other words, you can get
almost anywhere below ground.

00:10:02.068 --> 00:10:04.469
Master Otaru, does
this sound feasible?

00:10:04.537 --> 00:10:06.005
Uh... Y-Yeah...

00:10:06.439 --> 00:10:08.806
Otaru, what on earth
is wrong with you?

00:10:08.874 --> 00:10:10.899
H-Hey! What do you
think you're doing?!

00:10:10.977 --> 00:10:12.240
Well, you don't have a fever...

00:10:12.311 --> 00:10:14.473
I'm fine! See??

00:10:14.547 --> 00:10:16.106
That looks WEIRD.

00:10:17.149 --> 00:10:18.844
Now, all we need is
a plan of retreat.

00:10:18.918 --> 00:10:20.943
Of course. That
is absolutely vital.

00:10:21.420 --> 00:10:24.117
I can't let them
go into danger-...

00:10:25.157 --> 00:10:26.090
Listen, guys...!

00:10:26.158 --> 00:10:28.752
Don't be such a stranger, Otaru.

00:10:28.828 --> 00:10:31.923
I bet you're probably thinking of
sneaking into Gartlant on your own.

00:10:33.966 --> 00:10:35.934
Is that true, Otaru?

00:10:37.970 --> 00:10:39.904
We're very grateful...

00:10:39.972 --> 00:10:42.031
We're very grateful
you feel that way...

00:10:42.108 --> 00:10:44.975
...but if you did that,
we would be deeply hurt!

00:10:45.044 --> 00:10:47.672
We're all coming,
whether you like it or not!

00:10:47.747 --> 00:10:49.841
Yeah! We're all coming! We are!

00:10:50.182 --> 00:10:52.150
You guys...

00:11:02.595 --> 00:11:05.257
This will suffice as
an emergency escape route!

00:11:05.765 --> 00:11:08.234
"CHERRY'S GREAT GARTLANT COMPUTER-WRECKING PLAN!"
- Top Secret -

00:11:10.836 --> 00:11:12.531
I'm sorry, did I wake you?

00:11:12.605 --> 00:11:14.403
No, whatcha been doing?

00:11:14.473 --> 00:11:16.407
| was double-checking
our plan for tomorrow.

00:11:16.475 --> 00:11:20.275
We can't afford any slip-ups... So, get
some sleep. We have an early morning.

00:11:20.346 --> 00:11:21.814
Okay. Good night.

00:11:22.515 --> 00:11:24.415
Master Otaru certainly is kind.

00:11:24.483 --> 00:11:28.784
| can't believe he would go it
alone, just to keep us safe...

00:11:29.021 --> 00:11:31.991
| would go it alone too,
if it would keep Otaru safe!

00:11:32.058 --> 00:11:33.025
I bet you would!

00:11:33.092 --> 00:11:36.426
Remember how Otaru said
war is pointless?

00:11:36.495 --> 00:11:38.293
How come Faust
doesn't know that?

00:11:38.364 --> 00:11:39.126
I don't know.

00:11:39.198 --> 00:11:42.793
Doesn't he know how horrible it
is to lose loved ones to a war?

00:11:43.235 --> 00:11:45.033
Loved ones?

00:11:45.104 --> 00:11:47.630
Do wars take away loved ones?

00:11:48.107 --> 00:11:50.075
So long!

00:12:02.955 --> 00:12:04.548
I don't like this...

00:12:04.623 --> 00:12:06.455
I don't want to lose Otaru...

00:12:06.525 --> 00:12:07.617
I don't!

00:12:22.541 --> 00:12:25.511
Where Otaru goes,
Mitsurugi Hanagata goes!

00:12:25.578 --> 00:12:28.639
And, as an added bonus, I will
bring my lovingly packed lunches!

00:12:29.081 --> 00:12:31.243
Hanagata, I'm starved...

00:12:31.317 --> 00:12:33.911
Here, Otaru! Help yourself
to one of my own packed lunches.

00:12:33.986 --> 00:12:38.321
Wow! That's so thoughtful,
Hanagata! You're the best!

00:12:38.390 --> 00:12:40.358
- Give us a kiss!
- Oh, dear! Oh, my!

00:12:41.026 --> 00:12:42.871
| can't wait!
I can hardly wait!!

00:12:42.895 --> 00:12:44.158
"SABU" | can't wait!
I can hardly wait!!

00:12:54.206 --> 00:12:56.368
I don't want to lose Otaru.

00:12:59.011 --> 00:13:02.037
I'm going to go talk to Faust
and get him to stop the war!

00:13:06.519 --> 00:13:07.577
What...?

00:13:17.897 --> 00:13:19.797
So there you are, Lord Faust.

00:13:19.865 --> 00:13:22.129
How does it feel to wake up
to a newly seized territory?

00:13:22.835 --> 00:13:24.234
Not unpleasant.

00:13:24.303 --> 00:13:28.365
Very soon now, we will have control
of all of Peterburg's systems.

00:13:28.440 --> 00:13:33.537
The cloning manufactory and neonatal
care center are in your hands.

00:13:33.612 --> 00:13:35.046
Then, we will proceed as planned...

00:13:35.114 --> 00:13:36.479
| want results!

00:13:36.549 --> 00:13:38.142
Leave it to me, m'Lord.

00:13:41.620 --> 00:13:42.951
Lord Faust.

00:13:43.022 --> 00:13:45.684
We have received word
that there is going to be...

00:13:45.758 --> 00:13:48.728
...an infiltration attempt
into Gartlant from Japoness.

00:13:49.361 --> 00:13:51.955
It is likely to be lead
by those Japoness sabers.

00:13:52.031 --> 00:13:54.295
Tiger and Panther have already
departed to welcome them.

00:13:55.034 --> 00:13:56.627
Do not act on your own!!

00:13:56.702 --> 00:13:59.535
All I expect you three to do
is to obey my orders!

00:13:59.605 --> 00:14:02.540
I have no excuse, my Lord!
I should not have disturbed your rest!

00:14:02.608 --> 00:14:05.270
| will accept any punishment!
Please forgive me!

00:14:19.058 --> 00:14:19.401
Huh?

00:14:19.425 --> 00:14:20.435
"Lime + Otaru” (24
tick marks) Huh?

00:14:20.459 --> 00:14:21.858
"Lime + Otaru”
(24 tick marks)

00:14:22.127 --> 00:14:24.357
| came back to the
same spot AGAIN.

00:14:25.998 --> 00:14:28.023
I know! I'll have a snack!

00:14:33.138 --> 00:14:36.039
Mousie! Did you come along
'cause you were worried about me?

00:14:37.042 --> 00:14:39.101
Thanks! Let's have
a snack together!

00:14:40.646 --> 00:14:42.444
Huh? Empty?

00:14:44.183 --> 00:14:47.414
| won't lose hope! I have to
keep going, to protect Otaru!

00:14:49.054 --> 00:14:50.818
It's okay, I'm not angry.

00:14:51.957 --> 00:14:53.857
Hey, that tickles!

00:14:58.063 --> 00:14:59.997
Come on in, we're expecting you.

00:15:00.065 --> 00:15:02.124
We'll give you a reception
like you'll never forget.

00:15:05.871 --> 00:15:07.566
You're absolutely sure, Hanagata?

00:15:07.640 --> 00:15:10.610
It's true, I tell you. She said
she was going to talk to Faust!

00:15:11.510 --> 00:15:12.238
Lime...

00:15:14.213 --> 00:15:15.612
Hey, mousie... Did you know?

00:15:15.681 --> 00:15:18.616
| was told that you can
lose loved ones to a war.

00:15:19.118 --> 00:15:22.179
It doesn't make much sense, does it?
| can't understand it either!

00:15:22.254 --> 00:15:24.689
But, I sure don't
want to lose Otaru.

00:15:25.724 --> 00:15:27.214
Huh...?

00:15:27.293 --> 00:15:29.352
It splits in two.
Which way should I go?

00:15:30.362 --> 00:15:33.093
What? Are you going
to show me the way?!

00:15:40.873 --> 00:15:42.034
What's that?

00:15:42.107 --> 00:15:43.040
It's a waterfall!

00:15:43.108 --> 00:15:45.736
The water from above ground
is rushing underground!

00:15:49.982 --> 00:15:51.450
Wait up?

00:15:57.856 --> 00:15:59.324
Why'd you stop?

00:16:14.940 --> 00:16:16.840
What, another dead end?!

00:16:16.909 --> 00:16:18.502
That's not on the map anywhere.

00:16:18.577 --> 00:16:21.979
The underground strata of Terra ll
must be really unstable.

00:16:22.047 --> 00:16:24.015
So that's why the land
formations keep changing...

00:16:24.083 --> 00:16:26.609
If we can't get through here,
we'll have to go the long way around.

00:16:32.691 --> 00:16:33.988
We found you.

00:16:34.059 --> 00:16:35.527
Are you alone?

00:16:35.594 --> 00:16:37.187
HEY!

00:16:37.262 --> 00:16:40.254
Just who I wanted to see!
| want to talk to Faust!

00:16:40.332 --> 00:16:41.993
You want to talk to the fuhrer?

00:16:42.067 --> 00:16:45.002
Yeah! I came to talk!
| want to stop the war!

00:16:45.070 --> 00:16:46.003
What?!

00:16:46.071 --> 00:16:47.596
| want to stop the war.

00:16:47.673 --> 00:16:49.300
Don't you mock us!!

00:16:51.343 --> 00:16:51.935
Lime!

00:16:52.011 --> 00:16:53.479
What is it?!

00:16:54.680 --> 00:16:56.011
Did something happen?

00:16:56.081 --> 00:16:57.776
Lime is in danger!

00:16:58.017 --> 00:16:59.246
She's on the other side!

00:16:59.318 --> 00:17:01.810
Fine! If there's no path,
| can always MAKE one!

00:17:04.623 --> 00:17:06.091
Let's go!

00:17:13.432 --> 00:17:16.060
You dare to tell Lord Faust
what to do?! Cheeky kid!

00:17:16.535 --> 00:17:19.732
But... I don't want
to lose Otaru...!

00:17:20.606 --> 00:17:22.734
I'm going to pay you back
for what you did before.

00:17:29.715 --> 00:17:30.705
Lime!!

00:17:30.783 --> 00:17:31.716
Otaru...

00:17:34.686 --> 00:17:37.348
I haven't introduced myself yet.
I am Tiger!

00:17:37.423 --> 00:17:38.948
Did you escape from
a Gartlant zoo?

00:17:39.024 --> 00:17:40.219
Let her go!

00:17:40.292 --> 00:17:41.760
This won't stop me!

00:17:49.134 --> 00:17:50.602
Lime!!

00:17:51.003 --> 00:17:52.402
You'll pay for this!

00:17:53.405 --> 00:17:54.338
Master Otaru!

00:17:54.573 --> 00:17:56.041
Die!

00:17:57.943 --> 00:17:59.934
I'm going to protect Otaru!

00:18:00.012 --> 00:18:00.877
Lime!

00:18:00.946 --> 00:18:02.436
You lousy brat!

00:18:06.018 --> 00:18:08.009
I'm faster than you!

00:18:11.590 --> 00:18:13.115
Were you aiming for the wall?

00:18:15.160 --> 00:18:16.628
Come back here!!

00:18:19.264 --> 00:18:20.698
Bloodberry!!

00:18:20.766 --> 00:18:22.393
Master Otaru, look out!

00:18:23.068 --> 00:18:24.536
Otaru!

00:18:31.477 --> 00:18:33.707
You lack real experience, kid.

00:18:34.079 --> 00:18:34.910
Lime...!

00:18:35.147 --> 00:18:36.615
Break, you!!

00:18:41.386 --> 00:18:43.946
A m-m-m-m-MOUSE"!

00:18:46.091 --> 00:18:46.922
Now, to finish you!

00:18:46.992 --> 00:18:49.427
It's a mouse, it's a mouse,
it's a mouse, IT'S A MOUSE!

00:18:51.296 --> 00:18:53.663
Get away! Don't touch me!
Don't come closer! STOP IT!

00:18:53.732 --> 00:18:55.063
What in the heck...?

00:18:55.134 --> 00:18:56.898
A m-m-m-m-mouse!

00:18:56.969 --> 00:19:00.132
That's it! Cherry! Go to
heat scan! Look at the ceiling!

00:19:00.205 --> 00:19:01.673
A-All right!

00:19:07.079 --> 00:19:09.309
Th-Th-They're up there!

00:19:09.381 --> 00:19:10.143
What's up there?!

00:19:10.215 --> 00:19:11.182
M-m-m...!

00:19:11.250 --> 00:19:12.513
Hit it.

00:19:12.584 --> 00:19:14.074
But...!"

00:19:14.253 --> 00:19:15.948
HITIT!

00:19:16.021 --> 00:19:17.989
Fine, but don't
hold me responsible!!

00:19:18.056 --> 00:19:20.423
| didn't wanna do it™

00:19:29.334 --> 00:19:30.802
Mice...!

00:19:31.537 --> 00:19:33.005
Maybe this wasn't
such a great idea.

00:19:40.045 --> 00:19:42.742
| HATE MICE"!

00:19:44.183 --> 00:19:45.912
What's going on?!

00:19:45.984 --> 00:19:47.418
Cherry!

00:19:48.520 --> 00:19:49.988
Bloodberry?!

00:19:51.023 --> 00:19:53.492
Now I remember! I read
about it in a book once.

00:19:53.926 --> 00:19:56.020
It said that
human girls hate mice!

00:19:56.094 --> 00:19:58.426
Yay! Lookit all my new friends!

00:19:59.698 --> 00:20:00.529
Huh?

00:20:00.666 --> 00:20:02.896
Their maiden circuits
reacted to the mice!

00:20:07.139 --> 00:20:08.573
What?

00:20:08.640 --> 00:20:10.608
They were allowed to infiltrate?

00:20:11.677 --> 00:20:15.375
You are saying that we were outdone
by those weak Japoness sabers?!

00:20:19.017 --> 00:20:20.985
| despise incompetents.

00:20:22.054 --> 00:20:24.580
Luchs, from here onwards,
you will be in command.

00:20:25.123 --> 00:20:26.591
Understood.

00:20:30.062 --> 00:20:32.861
Master Otaru,
we're almost inside Gartlant.

00:20:33.298 --> 00:20:34.766
Right!

00:20:37.202 --> 00:20:41.605
I didn't want to lose you, so ...

00:20:41.673 --> 00:20:44.142
...I wanted to tell him
that war was bad...!

00:20:45.177 --> 00:20:47.373
And then, the mousie
helped me, and then...!

00:20:47.446 --> 00:20:50.279
It's okay! I'm not going anywhere.

00:20:50.349 --> 00:20:52.147
You're not going to lose anybody!

00:20:52.217 --> 00:20:53.446
Really?

00:20:53.518 --> 00:20:54.952
Yup!

00:20:55.020 --> 00:20:56.886
Really, REALLY?

00:20:56.955 --> 00:20:58.081
Yup! Really!

00:20:58.156 --> 00:21:00.625
Really, really, really, REALLY??

00:21:01.126 --> 00:21:03.322
Really, really,
really, really, REALLY!!

00:21:03.562 --> 00:21:05.428
YAYM

00:21:05.497 --> 00:21:06.589
Otaru!!

00:21:06.665 --> 00:21:09.293
- You left me behind! How COULD you?!
- Hanagata, where have you been?!

00:21:09.368 --> 00:21:13.498
You went so far ahead, I lost my way!
You know how easily I get lost!

00:21:13.572 --> 00:21:14.869
| do not!

00:21:14.940 --> 00:21:17.272
All right, then!
Lime, Cherry, Bloodberry!!

00:21:17.342 --> 00:21:18.810
...and for now, Hanagata.

00:21:19.244 --> 00:21:21.713
Is that all I am to you??

00:21:21.947 --> 00:21:24.041
We're going to take out
Gartlant's strategic computer...

00:21:24.116 --> 00:21:25.982
...and return to Japoness!

00:21:26.051 --> 00:21:27.041
Yeah!

00:21:27.119 --> 00:21:28.018
Yes, Sir!

00:21:28.086 --> 00:21:29.713
Yo!

00:21:47.372 --> 00:21:51.104
When you're sad, when you're blue...

00:21:51.176 --> 00:21:54.840
...don't go off to be alone.

00:21:54.980 --> 00:21:57.915
Just think of me...

00:21:57.983 --> 00:22:02.511
...and I'll be there with you.

00:22:02.754 --> 00:22:06.520
Strength is a very important thing...

00:22:06.591 --> 00:22:10.255
...but tears are important, too.

00:22:10.429 --> 00:22:14.195
You can't do anything at all...

00:22:14.266 --> 00:22:15.961
...with a dried-up heart.

00:22:16.034 --> 00:22:19.993
You can't feel a thing.

00:22:22.107 --> 00:22:24.439
Tell me, why do people hide...

00:22:24.509 --> 00:22:29.470
...what they really feel inside?

00:22:29.648 --> 00:22:33.243
Take what you can do,
what you want to do...

00:22:33.452 --> 00:22:37.116
...one step at a time.

00:22:37.322 --> 00:22:41.020
I love the way you don't care...

00:22:41.093 --> 00:22:44.825
...how you have been
programmed to live.

00:22:44.996 --> 00:22:48.660
| would follow you anywhere.

00:22:48.867 --> 00:22:54.829
I'll never, ever let you go.

00:23:04.282 --> 00:23:05.716
Yoo-hoo! It's me, Lime!

00:23:05.784 --> 00:23:08.651
Everybody in Gartlant
looks so gloomy!

00:23:08.720 --> 00:23:12.418
Oh, I see. I bet that "main computer”
thing is picking on everybody.

00:23:12.491 --> 00:23:14.960
C'mon, Otaru!
Let's destroy it right now!

00:23:15.694 --> 00:23:18.459
Huh? A feint? What's that?

00:23:18.530 --> 00:23:21.864
Is it good to eat?
What color is it? And, and...

00:23:22.901 --> 00:23:27.348
Infiltration Of The Dark Empire
Next on Saber Marionette J!

00:23:27.372 --> 00:23:28.897
Infiltration Of The Dark
Empire I love you, Otaru!!
